# Vendored guidance assets are byte-compared against their upstream sources by
# the sync and drift tooling. Without a fixed end-of-line they would normalize
# to CRLF on Windows checkouts and every later sync would report wholesale
# drift against LF upstream content.
/.github/instructions/genesis/** text eol=lf linguist-generated=true
/.github/skills/**              text eol=lf
/.github/genesis-guidance.schema.json text eol=lf
/.github/instruction-profile.json     text eol=lf
/scripts/guidance/**            text eol=lf
